  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "Which of the following operations has the same effect on a number as multiplying by \\(\\dfrac34\\) and then dividing by \\(\\dfrac35?\\)",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "dividing by \\(\\dfrac43\\)"
    },
